cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the FLORCA paper."
title: "FloatingOrca - Middleware 2026 Artifact Evaluation Helper"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/floating-orca/florca-middleware-artifact-evaluation-helper"
abstract: >-
  Convenience scripts to build and run FLORCA v0.8.1, the system described in
  "FLORCA: A Lightweight Runtime for Dynamic Serverless Function Coordination
  and Execution" (Middleware '26), for artifact evaluation.
